    shortAnswer: 'This is a monotonic-read violation from reads being load-balanced across followers with different replication lag — a refresh can hit a less caught-up follower after a previous read hit a more current one, making the update appear to disappear. Fix by routing a given user\'s session to the same replica (sticky reads) or by routing reads to the leader for a short window after that user\'s own write.',
